      "locator": "complete filmmaker",
      "text_sha256": "bcd36222703c4782b8613cb69cadab156d8595074c877c498dd3ae09c7b0ab53",
      "excerpt_preview": "This range makes the idea of a complete filmmaker descriptively useful when it is tied to specific work.",
      "excerpt_truncated": false,
      "screen_only": true
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "0ad67abc-a378-4e73-9ddb-2c719644e9bc",
      "locator": "layout, typography, calligraphy and illustration",
      "text_sha256": "47fcabf6f2c9ca853e1adbebdba7c30c9215bbf75f31ba02ff4e3329383b125e",
      "excerpt_preview": "His training in layout, typography, calligraphy and illustration preceded filmmaking and continued in his posters, credits and publications.",
      "excerpt_truncated": false,
      "screen_only": true
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "47208e87-e0c0-453e-b1a5-5f26b0d6a155",
      "locator": "editor, writer and composer",
      "text_sha256": "cf80163ec583398132af9c5d6373a97edbc3039324a17c2c6777fded1819b16e",
      "excerpt_preview": "Ray worked as director, screenwriter, illustrator, designer, editor, writer and composer.",
      "excerpt_truncated": false,
      "screen_only": true
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "659652a7-c428-4881-ace9-417af42f27d6",
      "locator": "Signet Press",
      "text_sha256": "93e84bf3794bcf7001c91300212e34373b3189ac83f260632c094b7a41506c18",
      "excerpt_preview": "At the publishing house Signet Press he designed book covers and illustrated texts, including a children’s edition of Bibhutibhushan Bandyopadhyay’s Pather Panchali.",
      "excerpt_truncated": false,
      "screen_only": true
    }
